        "body_raw": "Str 13, Stunning Fist."
      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "Before making a melee attack with an unarmed strike, you can expend one use of Stunning Fist to declare a stone-handed strike. Resolve the attack normally, except your attack ignores an amount of the target’s hardness equal to your monk level or one-quarter your base attack bonus (minimum 1), whichever is higher. This effect replaces other effects or conditions that would be caused by your Stunning Fist."
      }
